{
  "slug": "genpptx",
  "name": "Genpptx",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generate PowerPoint presentations (.pptx) from content files (meeting notes, memos) using Claude Code. Simply provide a content file and the plugin automatically designs a story-driven slide structure, generates a spec.yaml, and produces both PPTX and HTML output — no API key required.         \n                                                                                                                                            \n  Key features:                                                                                                                                            \n  - AI-driven slide design: story structure (Problem → Solution → Impact)\n  - 10 built-in layouts: cover, section, content, two-column, table, chart, image-text, image-full, summary, closing                                       \n  - Theme system: extract design tokens from existing PPTX files to create custom themes                                                                 \n  - HTML output: view presentations in a browser without PowerPoint                                                                                        \n  - Read & analyze existing PPTX files for revision",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 agent**, **5 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Agents** (1): `slide-designer` (コンテンツを分析してストーリー型のスライド構成を設計しspec.yamlを生成する)\n- **Commands** (5): `catalog` (全レイアウトのサンプルカタログを生成する), `create` (コンテンツファイルからspec.yamlを設計してPPTXを生成する), `generate` (既存のspec.yamlからPPTXとHTMLを生成する), `read` (既存のPPTX・PDFファイルを読み取り内容を表示する), `theme` (既存のPPTX・PDFからデザイントークンを抽出してテーマを生成する)\n- **Hooks** (1): `hooks.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install genpptx@claude-community` from `yn01/claude-plugins` (`genpptx`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 5
  },
